            <div type="translation" source="bib:Kuppusamy+al2010_01">
                <p n="1">24th year <supplied reason="subaudible">of the reign</supplied> of śrī-Kaṉṉara-tēvar.</p>
                <p n="1-9"> Kaliyaṉ Maṉṟāṭi Aiyaṉ alias Irājātittappēraraiyaṉ, an official of Karai<note>A village.</note> has provided for making two pillars, two half pillars and a beam and did all that are necessary for this row in the western side of the hall, in front of the sanctum sanctorum, for the great Lord of śrī-Mūlastāṉam of Vākūr.</p>
                <p n="10">This is to last as long as the moon and the
sun will last.</p>
            </div>
            
